+- [ ] Obtain the original disk manifest, full Frankel index and the communications behind the 2012 and 2018 completeness accounts. Test whether missing identifiers, including A2682, existed in or were absent from each separately dated set.
+- [ ] Retain the original field measurements, steel custody and NIST building-attribution rationale as separate W14A targets. Leave effects of individual connection revisions to the assigned technical review and its available model files.
+
+## Verification scope
+
+The NIST-hosted nine-page PDF was acquired November 14, 2026 UTC and hashed. Its title and relevant slide were extracted; slide 5 was also visually inspected from a rendered page. The held 524,288-byte mirror ZIP suffix was rehashed and reparsed to reproduce all **2,597** listed entries and the extension counts. The 2012 article's release paragraph was reread from the previously held HTML. The tests cover the specified text, archive-directory labels and arithmetic; they do not inspect each image or establish a file-to-sheet map. [Source pins and test details](SOURCE-PINS.json) · [Additive text diff](TEXT-CHANGES.diff)
